n style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">】</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">营造良好环境和氛围…………………………</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">24</span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: distribute-all-lines; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><a href="http://10.176.17.2/ke7v8Dye/Contents/Content.aspx?Action=Modify&amp;NodeID=25&amp;GeneralID=12855&amp;ModelID=1&amp;LinkType=0#_Toc22290"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext">附件</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext">1</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext">：</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">绍兴市教育现代化建设“</span>1610<span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">”政策体系……………</span>25</span></a></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: distribute-all-lines; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><a href="http://10.176.17.2/ke7v8Dye/Contents/Content.aspx?Action=Modify&amp;NodeID=25&amp;GeneralID=12855&amp;ModelID=1&amp;LinkType=0#_Toc27780"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext">附件</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext">2</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext">：绍兴市学校“十四五”重大建设项目一览表</span></a></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">………</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">26</span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 39px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"></span></p><p> </p><span style="COLOR: windowtext"><br style="PAGE-BREAK-BEFORE: always" clear="all" /></span><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 29px"> </span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 29px">绍兴市教育事业“十四五”发展规划</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 29px"> </span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">为在全省</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">率先高水平实现教育现代化</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">，推动我市教育向更高质量、更有效率、更加公平、更可持续发展，依据《浙江省教育事业发展“十四五”规划》和《绍兴市率先高水平实现教育现代化</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">2035</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">行动纲要》《绍兴市国民经济和社会发展第十四个五年规划》，制订本规划。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">一、</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">现实基础和</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">发展形势</span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">“</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">十三五</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">”</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">时期，市委、市政府</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持把教育摆在优先发展的战略地位，统筹推进教育改革发展各项工作，完成了既定的各项主要目标任务，教育现代化程度大幅提升，已经具备了率先高水平实现教育现代化的现实基础：学前教育普惠发展，省二级及以上优质幼儿园在园儿童覆盖面达</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">70.32%</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">，普惠性幼儿园在园儿童覆盖面达</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">93.20%</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">，学前教育家长满意度连续三年雄居全省第一；义务教育均衡发展，义务教育巩固率达</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">100%</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">，实现全国义务教育发展基本均衡县、省级教育基本现代化县全覆盖；高中教育特色多样，各区、县（市）均培育出</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">1</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">所以上优质普通高中，高考总体成绩稳居全省前四位。职业教育融合发展，全市</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">90%</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">的中职学校推行现代学徒制人才培养模式，与</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">1526</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">家企业签订校企长期合作协议，拥有</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">11</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">个省级中职校企合作共同体，中职学生获得全国技能大赛金牌数年年位居全省第一；高等教育扩容至</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">11</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">所，在校生数突破</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">11</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">万人，高校规模跃居全省第三；终身学习渠道融会贯通，建成老年大学（老年学堂）</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">101</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">家，常住人口成人教育受</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">训率</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">达</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">25.96%</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">；教师队伍提质发展，师风师德持续向好，中小学省特级教师达到</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">96</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">名，教师工资待遇依法得到保障。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">虽然我市教育事业取得了显著的成绩，但与人才强市战略要求和人民群众期盼相比较还有明显差距，发展不平衡不充分的矛盾还不同程度地存在：教育理念还不够先进，优质教育资源供给还不够充分，教育治理水平还有待提升，教师队伍结构还不够合理，服务经济社会发展还不够等。这些短板问题亟待破解。“十四五”期间，绍兴教育发展面临全新的形势：世界百年未有之大变局进入加速演变期，我国进入新发展阶段，新发展理念和新发展格局对教育结构提出了新要求，大数据、人工智能等新技术的发展正在不断重塑教育形态，知识获取方式和传授方式、教和学关系也在发生深刻变化，人民群众对优质教育的需求更加多样、更为迫切。全市教育工作者要深刻认识习近平总书记赋予浙江“努力成为新时代全面展示中国特色社会主义制度优越性的重要窗口”的新使命，深刻认识省委赋予绍兴“率先走出争创社会主义现代化先行省的市域发展之路”的新任务，奋发有为、奋勇争先，实现新时代共同成长的美好教育篇章。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">二、总体要求</span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">（一）指导思想</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，全面贯彻党的教育方针，落实立德树人根本任务，以在全省率先高水平实现教育现代化为目标，以打造共同成长的教育为根本出发点，以促进优质均衡发展为重要立足点，以深化教育改革开放为动力，以提升教育治理现代化为保障，努力建设活力、和谐、品质的高质量现代教育体系。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">（二）基本原则</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">1.</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持党的领导</span></strong><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">。</span></strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持党对教育事业的全面领导，以“五星育人，三名争创”为总抓手，强化学校党的建设。稳健推行党组织领导下的校长负责制，深化高校党委领导下的校长负责制，形成落实党的领导纵到底、横到边、全覆盖的工作格局。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">2.</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持优先发展</span></strong><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">。</span></strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持把优先发展教育事业作为推动经济社会发展发展的重要先手棋，做到</span><span style="BACKGROUND: white; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">建设优先投入，人才优先</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">引进，困难优先解决，典型优先宣传。科学配置区域教育资源，调整优化教育结构，加快补齐教育短板。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">3.</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持立德树人</span></strong><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">。</span></strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">始终坚守教育初心，为党育人、为国育才，培养担当民族复兴大任的时代新人。加强大中小学德育一体化体系建设，健全学校家庭社会协同育人机制。遵循教育规律和学生成长规律，促进学生德智体美劳全面发展。</span></span></p><p style="LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">4.</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持依法治</span></strong><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">教</span></strong><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">。</span></strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">深入推进“放管服”改革，完善政府治教方式和治理体系。坚持依法治教、依章治校，倡导科学管理、民主治理。优化教育评价取向，强化教育督导，形成社会多元参与、共同治教的新机制。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">5.</span></strong><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">坚持共同成长。</span></strong><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">统筹兼顾、把握重点，更加注重系统性、整体性、协同性，实现发展质量、结构、规模、速度、效益、安全相统一，实现学段之间协调成长、区域之间抱团成长、校际之间互助成长、师生之间同步成长、校园内外和谐成长。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">（三）主要目标</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">到</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">2025</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">年，总体实现教育现代化。</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">5</span><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">个区、县（市）达到省教育现代化县评估标准，教育现代化发展指数达到</span></span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">90</span><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">以上，市域教育现代化水平保持在全省第一方阵。学前教育更加优质普惠，实现全国学前教育普及普惠区、县（市）全覆盖。义务教育更加优质均衡，实现全国义务教育优质均衡发展区、县（市）全覆盖。高中教育更加优质多元、普职协调，基本形成“分类办学、特色发展”。高等教育实现规模扩张、内涵提升，成功更名绍兴大学，基本建成高等教育强市。服务全民终身学习的教育体系不断完善，基本实现教育治理现代化，绍兴教育成为我省重要窗口的卓越构成，成为共同成长的典型样板。</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; LINE-HEIGHT: 37px; TEXT-INDENT: 43px; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"><span style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: windowtext; FONT-SIZE: 21px">（四）核心指标</span></span></p><table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="586" uetable="null"><thead><tr style="HEIGHT: 30px" class="firstRow"><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: